Diocese → deanery → parish. The bundled OrgDemo sample has no deanery layer, so there is no live graph here. See [[Help:Saintapedia Graph/Province]] for a parent/child diagram.

Store the deanery as the parish's parent; give each deanery page a parent of the diocese. <code>Kind</code> values like Diocese / Deanery / Parish color the layers.

